### Step 4: Rearrangement Inequality

The **Rearrangement Inequality** states that for two sequences \( x_1 \leq x_2 \leq \dots \leq x_n \) and \( y_1 \leq y_2 \leq \dots \leq y_n \), the sum \( \sum_{i=1}^n x_i y_i \) is maximized when the sequences are ordered similarly and minimized when ordered oppositely.

