Expand both sides:
\[ 3nx + 2ny = 12x + 12y \]

Rearrange all terms to one side:
\[ 3nx + 2ny - 12x - 12y = 0 \]

Combine like terms:
\[ (3n - 12)x + (2n - 12)y = 0 \]

